# Register of known alignments between vocabularies (guide/linked-data.md, R17, criterion 8).
#
# An alignment may live in neither of the two vocabularies it connects, e.g. the SOSA-SAREF
# alignment is a separate module of SSN/SOSA 2023, not part of SAREF, and LOV does not record it.
# Add every alignment a project finds, so that the next project does not have to discover it again.
#
# One entry per alignment module: the module is an owl:Ontology; dcterms:references lists the
# namespaces it connects (as IRIs, matched as prefixes by tools such as ld-mcp vocabulary_profile);
# dcterms:source is the RDF file, rdfs:seeAlso the documentation, rdfs:comment the status.
# Only DCTERMS, OWL and RDFS are used: they dereference as RDF (R17, criterion 1); VoID and VOAF
# currently do not.
#
# Not listed, because there is no RDF module: the alignment with the OGC SensorThings API
# (https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn-2023/#STA-alignment), which is a mapping table only.
#
# This file describes the modules; it is not an ontology to load. Load a module itself (its
# dcterms:source) when a mapping relies on it.

@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/prov/> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "SOSA alignment with PROV"@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/2023/prov> ;
    dcterms:references
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> ,
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/w3c/sdw-sosa-ssn/blob/gh-pages/ssn/rdf/ontology/alignments/sosa-prov.ttl> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn-2023/#PROV-alignment> ;
    rdfs:comment "Part of SSN/SOSA 2023 (W3C Working Draft, 2026-10-07). Most axioms are also in the SOSA 2023 core; new here: sosa:Deployment rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity."@en .

<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/saref> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "SOSA alignment with SAREF"@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/2023/saref> ;
    dcterms:references
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> ,
        <https://saref.etsi.org/core/> ,
        <https://saref.etsi.org/saref4syst/> ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/w3c/sdw-sosa-ssn/blob/gh-pages/ssn/rdf/ontology/alignments/sosa-saref.ttl> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn-2023/#SAREF-alignment> ;
    rdfs:comment "Part of SSN/SOSA 2023 (W3C Working Draft, 2026-10-07). Aligns SOSA with SAREF core v4.1.1 and SAREF4SYST v1.1.2, e.g. sosa:Asset rdfs:subClassOf saref:FeatureOfInterest, saref:Device rdfs:subClassOf sosa:System."@en .

<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/oboe> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "SOSA alignment with OBOE"@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/2023/oboe> ;
    dcterms:references
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> ,
        <http://ecoinformatics.org/oboe/oboe.1.0/oboe-core.owl#> ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/w3c/sdw-sosa-ssn/blob/gh-pages/ssn/rdf/ontology/alignments/sosa-oboe.ttl> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn-2023/#OBOE-alignment> ;
    rdfs:comment "Part of SSN/SOSA 2023 (W3C Working Draft, 2026-10-07)."@en .

<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/dul> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "SOSA alignment with DOLCE+DnS Ultralite"@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/2023/dul> ;
    dcterms:references
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> ,
        <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#> ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/w3c/sdw-sosa-ssn/blob/gh-pages/ssn/rdf/ontology/alignments/sosa-dul.ttl> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-ssn-2023/#DUL-alignment> ;
    rdfs:comment "Part of SSN/SOSA 2023 (W3C Working Draft, 2026-10-07)."@en .

<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/dolce> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "SOSA alignment with DOLCE"@en ;
    owl:versionIRI <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/2023/dolce> ;
    dcterms:references
        <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> ,
        <https://w3id.org/DOLCE/OWL/DOLCEbasic#> ;
